  "html": "<h1 data-block=\"blk-1d61aa2a062b538a\" id=\"_1\">参考文献</h1>\n<p data-block=\"blk-e4dd11c1676c55f2\">[1] Thomas H. Cormen, et al. Introduction to Algorithms (3rd Edition).</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-3eb0bcb372bafe54\">[2] Aditya Bhargava. Grokking Algorithms: An Illustrated Guide for Programmers and Other Curious People (1st Edition).</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-973620f36de06632\">[3] Robert Sedgewick, et al. Algorithms (4th Edition).</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-eb72f51fbff23513\">[4] 严蔚敏. 数据结构（C 语言版）.</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-3550e8235da40bcf\">[5] 邓俊辉. 数据结构（C++ 语言版，第三版）.</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-3f84b50bae954aed\">[6] 马克 艾伦 维斯著，陈越译. 数据结构与算法分析：Java语言描述（第三版）.</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-a9bccea16c6277f0\">[7] 程杰. 大话数据结构.</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-ec6488a7ba795bdb\">[8] 王争. 数据结构与算法之美.</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-22e469e953b4ee57\">[9] Gayle Laakmann McDowell. Cracking the Coding Interview: 189 Programming Questions and Solutions (6th Edition).</p>\n<p data-block=\"blk-9ff122564a529ee3\">[10] Aston Zhang, et al. Dive into Deep Learning.</p>",
